"position": "Head Coach",
"gender": "Male",
"appearance": "David is tall and solidly built, with short, graying hair and a neatly trimmed beard. His intense blue eyes and stern expression often convey his no-nonsense attitude.",
"personality": "David is known for his strict, disciplined approach to coaching. He values hard work and dedication but can be impatient with players who don't meet his high standards. Despite his tough exterior, he is deeply committed to the team's success.",
"traits": ["Disciplined", "Demanding", "Strategic", "Loyal"],
