"partner": {
"name": "Sarah Mitchell",
"age": 43,
"occupation": "Clinical Psychologist",
"interesting_fact": "Sarah and David met during a sports psychology seminar, and she has been instrumental in helping him manage his competitive drive and occasional temper."
