"position": "Assistant Coach",
"gender": "Female",
"appearance": "Linda is of average height, with long, dark hair often tied back in a ponytail. She has a warm smile and a friendly demeanor, though her sharp eyes suggest she misses little.",
"personality": "Linda is approachable and empathetic, known for her ability to connect with players on a personal level. She’s an excellent strategist but tends to be overly protective of her players, sometimes to a fault.",
